WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: If You Walked Away (1-04)
NOTE Artist: The Stardust Engine
NOTE Album: Neon Hearts (1989)

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:18.000
[Gentle Late-Night Piano & Synth Intro]

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:23.000
The streetlights make a blurry line

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:30.500
I'm running through the same old signs

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:37.500
I'm just a face in a passing crowd

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:45.000
Afraid to speak my thoughts out loud

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:53.200
But then you found me in the noise

00:00:55.200 --> 00:01:00.200
You heard a whisper in my voice

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:07.500
You gave me something to believe

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:15.200
