00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:19.800
If you walked away

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:23.800
The sky would lose its blue

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:27.500
I wouldn't know what to do

00:01:27.700 --> 00:01:31.200
I'd be lost in the gray

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:35.200
If you walked away

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:40.000
My world would fall apart

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:49.000
You're the owner of my neon heart

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:55.800
[Soft Piano Interlude]

00:01:56.000 --> 00:02:01.500
They build these walls so high and steep

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:08.600
