00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:15.500
But we have a fortress, strong and true

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:23.500
I'm safe as long as I have you

00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:27.900
If you walked away

00:02:28.100 --> 00:02:31.500
The sky would lose its blue

00:02:31.700 --> 00:02:34.600
I wouldn't know what to do

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:37.000
I'd be lost in the gray

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:42.600
If you walked away

00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:48.600
My world would fall apart

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:57.500
You're the owner of my neon heart

00:02:57.700 --> 00:03:03.500
[Melodic Keyboard Interlude]

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:07.400
I'm holding on, I'm holding tight

00:03:07.600 --> 00:03:17.500
Don't let me go into the night...

00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:21.200
If you walked away

00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:25.200
The sky would lose its blue

00:03:25.400 --> 00:03:28.800
I wouldn't know what to do

